    "title": "GATEWAY-batchinsertion-List Telecom Sim Historys-v3-spec",
    "description": "The Telecom SIM History Retrieval API enables users to access historical data regarding telecom SIM transactions. This endpoint is designed for telecom service providers and analytics teams to efficiently query and retrieve essential information about SIM card usage trends over time. By leveraging this API, businesses can gain insights into customer behavior, track SIM lifecycle events, and enhance decision-making processes. Typical consumers of this API include data analysts, business intelligence teams, and application developers focused on telecom systems.",
